    },
    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "6d378cbf66b64afd8266": "We have more than one enemy in Silithus, $N.$B$BWhile everyone's attention is focused on the silithid, my big brother and I have been keeping a close eye on the Twilight's Hammer crazies.\n\n"
      },
      "name": "Bor Wildmane",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
